  "requiredImplementationGuards": [
    "Keep the existing Dar Chaabane exception unchanged: its helper hard-codes623/468, outside-base policy, different city/sector names and a town-kind point; these cases must not fake those facts.",
    "Use a separate contained-settlement/base method if independently approved. Permit source residential relation as well as way IDs, and source point kind town or village.",
    "Bind the exact installed two-member before group, then require distinctPairs to leave source city and sector singletons before the base association. Require base target to have no other raw members.",
