    "Require exact source/effective tags, geometry hashes, no target curation, full current metadata and packed-byte hashes. Source points remain absent raw and are never used as new manual coordinates.",
    "Require the unchanged base and absorbed point inside both original and packed residential geometry, exact Arabic identity and equal raw city/sector/base prayer source. Do not require base inside the imada.",
    "Do not require shared Wikidata or a common displayed parent: these are absent or differ. Preserve Ghomrassen residential governorate-only context exactly.",
    "A future generator pass must check relevant source/name and code inventories against live inputs; this cached subset is not a fresh global uniqueness claim."
